      "content": "thanks, i'll try the ice thing. honestly i don't really have time to go to the doctor right now, i'm super busy with work and it looks pretty minor compared to how it felt when i first tripped. u think i could just take some ibuprofen and wait a day or two to see if it gets better on its own? im pretty sure it's just a strain.",
